      "statement": "There are two conditional-write dialects: s3:// and az:// speak the etag dialect (If-Match/If-None-Match), while gs:// speaks the Cloud Storage XML API dialect with x-goog-if-generation-match and OAuth; the distinction is the dialect, not the endpoint.",
